<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-petals" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="petal p1"><path d="M12 2C7 2 2 7 2 12c5 0 10-5 10-10z"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="petal p2"><path d="M12 2C7 2 2 7 2 12c5 0 10-5 10-10z"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="petal p3"><path d="M12 2C7 2 2 7 2 12c5 0 10-5 10-10z"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="petal p4"><path d="M12 2C7 2 2 7 2 12c5 0 10-5 10-10z"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="petal p5"><path d="M12 2C7 2 2 7 2 12c5 0 10-5 10-10z"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Tables &middot; Chairs &middot; Decor Rentals</p>
    <h1>Your dream wedding,<br><em>beautifully furnished</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-text">We help couples across the region furnish their wedding with high-quality tables, chairs, and decor - matched to your style, from the first inquiry to pickup after the big day. We also rent to other celebrations and events, from birthdays to corporate gatherings.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/catalog" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Browse the Catalog</a>
      <a href="#about" class="btn btn-ghost btn-large">Learn More</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-trust">
      <li>★★★★★ from happy couples</li>
      <li>Personal consultation</li>
      <li>Delivery &amp; setup available</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <svg class="hero-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0,40 C360,100 1080,0 1440,50 L1440,100 L0,100 Z"></path>
  </svg>
</section>

<section class="usp-strip">
  <div class="container usp-grid">
    <div class="usp-item">
      <span class="usp-icon">💍</span>
      <h3>Wedding specialists</h3>
      <p>Weddings are our focus, but our catalog works just as well for birthdays, anniversaries, and corporate events.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="usp-item">
      <span class="usp-icon">🚚</span>
      <h3>Delivery &amp; setup</h3>
      <p>We can deliver, set up, and pick everything back up after the celebration - you focus on the day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="usp-item">
      <span class="usp-icon">🌿</span>
      <h3>A look that fits</h3>
      <p>Boho, classic-elegant, or modern minimalist - we help you put together a matching combination.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="usp-item">
      <span class="usp-icon">🤝</span>
      <h3>Personal service</h3>
      <p>We take the time to understand what you need, from the first conversation to the big day.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="catalog-preview">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">What We Offer</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Everything for your reception table</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Browse our full catalog, pick the quantities you need, and send us a request - no account required.</p>
    <a href="/catalog" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Open the Catalog</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section about section-alt" id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200">
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="92" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M100 60c-16 0-30 12-30 30 0 24 30 46 30 46s30-22 30-46c0-18-14-30-30-30z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">About Us</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Furnishing your special day, with care</h2>
      <p>[COMPANY NAME] grew out of a passion for beautiful celebrations. What started as a small collection of tables and chairs has grown into a full rental catalog that helps couples bring their wedding vision to life - and increasingly, other events too.</p>
      <p>Word of mouth has carried us for years - now we want to make it even easier to find us and send a request.</p>
      <p>Whether it's an intimate gathering, a large wedding party, or a birthday or corporate event, we listen, advise honestly, and make sure everything fits on the day.</p>
      <a href="/catalog" class="btn btn-primary">Browse the Catalog</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact" id="contact">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-info">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Tell us about your event</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Have a general question rather than a specific rental list? Send us a note and we'll get back to you.</p>

      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li>📍 [STREET ADDRESS, CITY, STATE ZIP]</li>
        <li>📞 <a href="tel:[PHONE NUMBER]">[PHONE NUMBER]</a></li>
        <li>✉️ <a href="mailto:[EMAIL ADDRESS]">[EMAIL ADDRESS]</a></li>
        <li>🕐 [BUSINESS HOURS]</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <form class="contact-form" method="POST" action="/contact">
      <div class="form-row">
        <label for="customerName">Name*</label>
        <input type="text" id="customerName" name="customerName" required autocomplete="name">
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <label for="customerEmail">Email*</label>
        <input type="email" id="customerEmail" name="customerEmail" required autocomplete="email">
      </div>
      <div class="form-row form-row-half">
        <div>
          <label for="eventType">Event type</label>
          <select id="eventType" name="eventType">
            <% eventTypes.forEach(function(t) { %><option value="<%= t %>"><%= t %></option><% }) %>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="eventDate">Event date</label>
          <input type="date" id="eventDate" name="eventDate">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <label for="message">Your message*</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="Tell us about your event: location, style, what you're looking for..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Send Message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
